@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.edit
@title Media loading — Edit only
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Edit only
@entry edit-path-change, edit-media-change
@summary Show only Edit-specific behavior around shared Files selection and shared viewer-media publication.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-add, functionality.media-loading.common.list-selection, functionality.media-loading.common.viewer, functionality.media-loading.common.publication
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag edit

@alias edit = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PEditTab

[edit-path-change] Edit Files current-path event <input>
= Shared Files logic published the current path through PListPathChange.
> edit-path-result

[edit-path-result] Edit selected-path adapter <decision>
- Log the selected file and current crop-persistence state, ignore blank selection, and request a nonblank path from the Edit viewer @ edit.PEditPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "Blank current path" > edit-no-request

[edit-no-request] Edit viewer request omitted <output>
= Edit records the empty selection and does not call the shared viewer-loading pipeline.

[edit-media-change] Edit viewer-media event <input>
= The common publication stage raised PViewerMediaChange for the Edit viewer.
> edit-restore

[edit-restore] Edit state restoration <process>
- Restore source-specific crop and edit state against the viewer state produced by the media event @ edit.PEditCropRestore(...)
> edit-restored

[edit-restored] Edit state synchronized <output>
= Edit-specific crop/edit state follows the resulting viewer source.
